    <string name="dev_link_title">Sambungan developer</string>
    <string name="dev_link_body">Nampilake input lan kabeh aplikasi TV, ngganti input ing TV sing ora nggubris tombol HDMI, lan nyetel kecerahan ing sawetara TV. Lumaku liwat sambungan debugging TV (ADB). Tombol lan ngetik tetep padha tanpa iki.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">Ing TV, bukak Settings › System › About lan pilih Android TV OS build kaping pitu. Ing TV lawas, iku Device Preferences › About › Build.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Bukak Developer options, ing sandhinge About, lan urupake USB debugging. Ing Shield, iku Network debugging.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_allow">Tutul Sambungake, banjur ing TV centhang Always allow lan pilih OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Sambungake</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow">Idini ing TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow_body">Centhang Always allow from this computer, banjur OK</string>
    <string name="dev_link_turn_off">Pateni</string>
    <string name="dev_link_off">Mati. Nambahake input lan kabeh aplikasi</string>
    <string name="dev_link_away">TV ora mangsuli. Bakal nyoba maneh dhewe sajrone remot isih kebukak.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Ora mangsuli</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">TV nolak sambungan. Priksa manawa USB debugging urip. Wiwit Android TV 14 sawetara TV mung nampa Wireless debugging, sing durung bisa dienggo TennaRC.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging mati ing TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">Mung Wireless debugging sing urip, sing durung bisa dienggo TennaRC. Urupake uga USB debugging, utawa pasangake saka komputer sepisan lan jalanake adb tcpip 5555, sing tahan nganti TV diwiwiti maneh.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless_short">Mung Wireless debugging sing urip</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed">Ora ana sing ngidini ing TV. Coba maneh, lan pilih OK ing kana.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed_short">Ora diidini ing TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten">TV wis lali karo telpon iki, kaya sing ditindakake Android TV marang piranti sing ora katon sajrone seminggu. Coba maneh, lan idini ing TV.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten_short">TV lali karo telpon iki</string>
